<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia 2006 T-bond yld averages 7.603 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia 2006 T-bond yld averages 7.603 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of today's A$600 million T-bond tender, announced by Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA):</p>
<p>  Stock	  Offering     Allotted	Avg yield   Range</p>
<p>  8.75 Jan 01  A$200 mln    A$200.53 mln   7.098    7.08-7.10</p>
<p>		   (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 80)</p>
<p>  Stock	  Offering     Allotted	Avg yield   Range</p>
<p>  6.75 Nov 06  A$400 mln    A$402.00 mln   7.603    7.58-7.61</p>
<p>		   (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 80)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
